{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52201","headline":"颂六十二首 二十六 · 道世","name":"颂六十二首 二十六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"冬狐理丰毳，春蚕绪轻丝。\n形骸翻爲阻，心识还自欺。\n龆齓歌鼓腹，平生少年时。\n驱车追侠客，酌酒弄妖姬。\n但念目前好，安知後世悲。\n惕然一以愧，永与情爱辞。\n愿识真妄本，染净自分离。\n羞惭滞五盖，焉知同四依。\n（见同书卷三一《引证部》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"道世","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52201.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52201","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}